  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      127.21,
      295.19,
      234.28
    ],
    "text": "The Honourable Minister of Labour Relations Gamini Lokuge,do by virtue of the powers vested in him by Section 4(1) ofthe Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter131, of the LegislativeEnactments of Ceylon (1956 Revised Edition), as amendedby Act, Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read withIndustrial Disputes \u2013 Special Provisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968hereby appointed me on 10.06.2014 to be the Arbitrator andreferred the above said dispute to me for settlement byArbitration.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      247.21,
      181.17,
      258.28
    ],
    "text": "Statement of matter in dispute:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      271.21,
      273.34,
      282.28
    ],
    "text": "The matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      295.21,
      295.19,
      342.28
    ],
    "text": "\"Whether the employees of the Cinnamon Grand Hotelhave been caused injustice by being punished in accordancewith the disciplinary practice implemented with effect from01.01.2010, and if so, to what reliefs they are entitled\".",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      355.21,
      111.31,
      366.28
    ],
    "text": "Appearances:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      378.49,
      147.45,
      389.56
    ],
    "text": "Party of the First Part:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
